{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468531.6435034, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:22:11.643507+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "VICTORIA I has **no identifiable Shodan footprint**. No onboard systems (VSAT terminals, navigation, passenger WiFi, CCTV) appear on public internet scanning. The 110 Tallink corporate hosts are backend infrastructure (tallink.com), not shipboard equipment.", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468531.6479585, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:22:11.647961+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "**Interpretation:** Expected for a modern passenger ferry by a major operator. Tallink likely:", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468531.6521635, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:22:11.652167+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "1. Routes vessel internet through private VSAT with carrier-grade NAT", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468531.656447, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:22:11.656450+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "2. Operates passenger WiFi through a managed onboard LAN", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468531.6606529, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:22:11.660656+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "3. Keeps OT systems on isolated networks", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468531.6650312, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:22:11.665034+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "4. Uses corporate VPN backhaul for management access", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468531.6694522, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:22:11.669456+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "The **absence of a footprint is itself the finding** \u2014 VICTORIA I demonstrates good network hygiene.", "line_type": "output"}
