{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468531.7431102, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:22:11.743113+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "### Ukraine Conflict Exposure", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468531.7476547, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:22:11.747658+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "Victoria I was **chartered by the UK Government** (July 2022\u2013July 2023) to house Ukrainian refugees in Port of Leith, Edinburgh. This elevated the vessel's profile for targeting by Russian-aligned hacktivists (Killnet) and intelligence gathering. Vessel returned to regular service August 2023.", "line_type": "output"}
