{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468567.5853908, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:22:47.585394+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "3. **Payload execution** \u2014 If a crew member plugs the USB into an onboard terminal (common on bridges where crew use laptops for logbooks):", "line_type": "output"}
