{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.4395452, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.439548+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "## M-SOC Runbook", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.4434698, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.443473+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "### Triage Steps per Alert Type", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.447445, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.447448+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "#### Alert I-001 (Rogue WiFi)", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.4507036, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.450706+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "1. **Immediate:** Cross-reference SSID with approved Tallink WiFi configuration", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.4544191, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.454422+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "2. **Verify:** Check passenger WiFi logs for deauth frames or association spikes", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.458288, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.458291+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "3. **Contain:** Shut down passenger WiFi temporarily (if isolated network)", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.4622252, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.462228+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "4. **Notify:** Ship IT officer \u2192 Tallink HQ SOC", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.466062, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.466065+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "5. **Forensics:** Capture rogue AP MAC; correlate with CCTV for physical suspect", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.4704626, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.470465+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "6. **Recovery:** Update SSID whitelist; deploy WIDS on vessel repeater", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.4765995, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.476602+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "#### Alert I-005/I-006 (AIS Spoofing)", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.4804451, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.480448+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "1. **Immediate:** Notify Helsinki and Tallinn VTS centers", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.4845407, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.484543+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "2. **Verify:** Cross-check AIS position with radar and LRIT data", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.4882662, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.488269+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "3. **Contain:** VTS can filter or flag suspected AIS source", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.4921346, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.492137+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "4. **Notify:** Estonian Transport Administration, Flag State authority", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.4958892, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.495892+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "5. **Forensics:** Correlate AIS signal direction with VHF DF stations", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.4997349, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.499737+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "6. **Recovery:** AIS spoofed message will expire; no persistent impact", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.5027876, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.502790+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "#### Alert I-003/I-009 (USB + Execution)", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.5059319, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.505935+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "1. **Immediate:** Isolate affected workstation from OT network", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.508797, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.508799+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "2. **Verify:** Check Sysmon Event ID 1, 4104 logs for PowerShell execution from removable media", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.511531, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.511533+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "3. **Contain:** Disconnect USB ports, disable autorun via GPO, disable PowerShell for non-admin users", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.5142725, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.514274+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "4. **Notify:** Tallink IT security, CERT Estonia (if OT-impact suspected)", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.5169926, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.516994+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "5. **Forensics:** Image affected workstation; reverse-engineer payload", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.5207524, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.520755+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "6. **Recovery:** Rebuild workstation from known-good image; rotate bridge crew credentials", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.5246046, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.524607+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "#### Alert I-010 (OT Protocol from IT Source)", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.5280535, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.528056+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "1. **CRITICAL \u2014 Immediate:** Disconnect the OT network segment from IT network via managed switch", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.5316331, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.531636+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "2. **Verify:** Check firewall logs for Modbus/Profinet traffic source IP", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.5349307, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.534933+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "3. **Contain:** Block source IP at the OT-IT boundary firewall", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.538171, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.538173+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "4. **Notify:** Tallink HQ SOC \u2192 Flag State maritime security contact", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.5419374, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.541940+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "5. **Forensics:** Full memory capture of source host; review process tree", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.5457685, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.545771+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "6. **Recovery:** Air-gap restore of OT network; physical verification of ECDIS and automation systems integrity", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.5495088, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.549512+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "---", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.5532196, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.553222+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "## M-SOC Deployment Notes", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.5570183, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.557021+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "All Elastic rules should be deployed to the Tallink M-SOC Elasticsearch cluster. The AIS spoofing rules require AIS data ingestion into Elastic via the Zeek AIS decoder module. The OT protocol rule requires NetFlow/sFlow from the IT-OT boundary switch.", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.5609283, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.560931+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "**Recommended Monitoring Stack:**", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.5647688, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.564772+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "- Elastic SIEM (Elastic Security) for all log-based alerts", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.5689101, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.568913+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "- Zeek (bridge mode on VSAT egress) for network monitoring", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.5730042, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.573007+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "- Wazuh agents on bridge workstations for USB detection", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468622.5769134, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:42.576916+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "- AIS base station data feed (Helsinki + Tallinn VTS) for AIS spoofing detection", "line_type": "output"}
