{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468627.6058252, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:47.605830+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "    Phase 0 \u2014 Equasis: \u2705 Success. Full identity: IMO 9281281, MMSI 276519000, call sign ESRP, Estonian flag, Tallink Group, 40,975 GT. Three management entities. Bureau Veritas class. 35 PSC inspections, last 3 clean.", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468627.612797, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:47.612800+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "    ", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468628.4700854, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:48.470091+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "    Phase 1 \u2014 AIS Tracking: \u2705 VesselFinder (CloakBrowser). Currently moored Tallinn (arrived 19:43 UTC). Destination FIHEL/EEVAN. ETA Jun 15, 13:00. 5 port calls extracted showing Tallinn\u2194Helsinki shuttle pattern. Average 14.6 kn, max 19.1 kn.", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468628.4774554, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:48.477459+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "    ", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468629.4156146, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:49.415620+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "    Phase 2 \u2014 Attack Surface (Shodan): \u2705 Zero hits on all queries (name, MMSI, IMO, call sign). 110 Tallink corporate hosts found. 680 port:3000 services in Estonia, 18,260 in Finland, none vessel-specific. Zero vessel-level footprint is the finding.", "line_type": "output"}
{"event": "phase_output", "ts": 1781468629.4221063, "iso": "2026-06-14T20:23:49.422110+00:00", "phase": 0, "line": "    ", "line_type": "output"}
